    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57559" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίσθος</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Dsc.
		</span></i> (v. infr.), <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>) or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κισθός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rock-rose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				14.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Mnesim.
				4.63
			</span></i> (anap.), prob.l.for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κισσός</span>
			in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.2.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἄρρην</span>, =
			<i>Cistus villosus</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. θῆλυς</span>,
				=
			<i>C. salvifolius</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.97
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίστος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Liqu.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.27
			</span></i>:—Dsc.l.c.sq. distinguishes the species <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίσθαρος</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίσσαρος</span></b>  from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῆδον</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.28
			</span></i>.</div>
